      "cooked": "<p>Did you know that End of Days will destroy cards underneath the Dreamer?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, if you've got eight cards underneath her already, you shouldn't have all the other heroes smugly do nothing while you wait for End of Days to finish off all the projections in play and win the game for you.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Filed under 'Things I learned beta testing'.</p>",
