      "created_at": "2016-01-17T21:31:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I suppose it makes sense -- the menu when using Environment destruction includes cards under Savage Mana or the Countdown pile.</p><p>Huh...this would make Fanatic good against Mad Bomber Blade, too, wouldn't it? End of Days would reset his damage on his front side by destroying all the cards under him.</p><p>Edit: Nevermind, just checked and all the cards under him are considered indestructible.</p>",
