      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-18T14:01:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since cards under other cards have no text, this means they have no hp either (as this is considered part of the text), therefore aren't targets. So anythign that acts on a <em>target</em> being destroyed when Savage Mana goes off wouldn't do so, but anything that acts on a <em>card</em> being destroyed would do.</p>",
