      "created_at": "2016-01-19T02:46:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Except the win condition on the Dreamer is at any time, right? So you can destroy Projections first, and win the game before End of Days proceeds to destroy the cards under the Dreamer. This just wouldn't work if you haven't reached the destruction target yet.</p>",
